  "hints": [
    "Never call eval() or exec(). Convert infix tokens to postfix (Shunting Yard) OR write recursive descent parsing: expr (+,-) -> term (*,/) -> factor (int, unary -, (expr)).",
    "For integer division, truncate toward zero with int(a / b) instead of a // b.",
    "Pseudocode (recursive descent):\n  parse_expr(): parse_term(), then loop + or -\n  parse_term(): parse_factor(), then loop * or /\n  parse_factor(): handle unary - / +, \"( expr )\", or integer literal"
